# LinkSOS Package List (x86_64)
# Optimized for minimal idle RAM + gaming + modern desktop
#
# RULE: Only packages that exist in core, extra, multilib, or archlinuxcn
# AUR-only packages (calamares, tela-icon-theme) are installed in
# customize_airootfs.sh via yay
#
# FIXED from previous build errors:
# - calamares        → NOT in any repo, moved to customize_airootfs.sh (yay)
# - tela-icon-theme  → NOT in any repo, moved to customize_airootfs.sh (yay)
# - adwaita-gtk-theme → NOT a real package, Adwaita is in gnome-themes-extra
# - steam-native-runtime → NOT in repos, removed (steam is sufficient)
# - p7zip            → Has provider conflict, replaced with 7zip

# === BASE SYSTEM ===
base
base-devel
linux-zen
linux-zen-headers
linux-firmware
linux-firmware-whence
systemd
systemd-sysvcompat
systemd-resolvconf
dbus-broker
util-linux
coreutils

# === BOOT & INSTALLER ===
grub
efibootmgr
os-prober
memtest86+
syslinux
squashfs-tools
# calamares installed via yay in customize_airootfs.sh (not in any repo)

